1. Current inference bundle

The author-supplied inference bundle includes Lightricks LTX model definitions
and runtime code. The complete LTX-2 Community License Agreement, including
Attachment A, is retained in LICENSE and applies to LTX-derived components
and model weights. Upstream copyright and attribution notices are retained.

The Flash package includes the project-provided UltraTinyVAE implementation,
its architecture configuration, checkpoint fusion, and joint inference code.

Release integration changes on 2026-09-30 add portable multistep launchers,
bundle the optional legacy TinyDecoder, and retain the earlier environment
variable interface. No training code or model weights are bundled here.

The Apache-2.0 text from the earlier repository is preserved in
licenses/Apache-2.0.txt for historical attribution. It does not replace the
LTX-2 Community License or relicense LTX-derived model weights. The Gemma
text encoder is obtained separately under Google's upstream terms.

